menu "E-paper display application"

    config APP_SENSOR_NAME_PREFIX
        string "BLE advertised-name prefix of the Govee sensor"
        default "GV5171"
        help
            The sensor advertises as e.g. H5171_1234 (see
            tempsensor/README.md). The scanner matches on this prefix.

    config APP_FULL_REFRESH_EVERY
        int "Full e-paper refresh every N wake cycles"
        default 15
        help
            The device wakes every 60 seconds. This setting says how many
            wakes pass between full e-paper refreshes. Partial refreshes are
            used on all other wakes to reduce power and flicker. The first
            refresh after boot is always a full one.

endmenu
